//RS /// Crate-private native fields glue outside `jet_foundation` can neither read
//RS /// nor write directly, each crossing through a public accessor pair:
//RS /// `(owner, field, getter -> Option<String>, setter(Option<&str>) -> Result)`.
//RS /// The native image codec persists these fields, so a restored compiler image
//RS /// only survives the Source MIR round trip when they cross both ways.
//RS /// `MirOptimizationFacts.derived_from_digest` is the optimizer pipeline seal;
//RS /// Source MIR carries it as the lowercase hex `mir_program_digest` spells.
//RS /// Carrying it (rather than re-digesting the program) keeps image restore
//RS /// linear in the program and free of whole-program digests.
